<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Baring One's Soul</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;We all do things in our life that we later regret. Some of these are small things, some of them are large. Some of them we move past quickly and others stay with us for years. But it's important to remember that, no matter how great your regret, you need to talk about these things with the people you love most. It's important to remember that you will always be able to find your way home so long as you try. Catra and Adora have a long overdo conversation as they confront some of these regrets.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
